Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash, firejail, bubblewrap
Description: Application sandboxing plugin for THMD-Guru Linux ATTT
 Provides `guru sandbox` to execute untrusted programs in isolated namespaces
 with dropped capabilities and optional network disconnection.
